<http://data.silknow.org/object/92b43355-746f-32dd-af00-c901e8d3493b/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Cabinet with scenes from the story of Rebecca worked in silk yarns, purl, and seed pearls embroidered on white silk; metal trim; metal feet; raised work on top and all four sides. Top has man and woman under canopy; two compartments in lid, wax effigy inside larger compartment. Doors open in front. Drawer fronts and door interiors are embroidered in silk yarns on white silk. Worn and soiled."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/92b43355-746f-32dd-af00-c901e8d3493b> .

